# Cartographer Frontend

## Stack

- React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind
- UI: shadcn/ui only — no parallel component libraries
- Map: CesiumJS; Titanium via `src/cesium/titanium` adapter stub only

## Structure

- `src/cesium/` — all Cesium/Titanium code; keep out of ordinary React UI components
- `src/api/` — typed HTTP client; components must not call `fetch` directly
- `src/models/` — Search, SearchArea, Detection, SearchLayer
- `src/components/ui/` — shadcn primitives
- `src/components/search/` — query, area mode, progress, detection detail

## UX

- Full-bleed map; sparse overlays (wordmark, NL search, area mode, quiet progress, slim selection sheet, small layer list)
- Area modes: viewport, radius, region
- Progressive search results via polling the Flask job API
